  "sourceText": "French Cream Filling\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Thursday, December 10, 2009 - 12:14am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n3/4 cup thick cream\n1/4 cup powdered sugar\n1/4 cup milk\nWhite one egg\n1/2 teaspoon vanilla\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Dilute cream with milk and beat until stiff, using an egg-beater. Add sugar, white of egg beaten until stiff, and vanilla.",
